#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WallaceToughestInHoenn"
msgid ""
"WALLACE is rumored to be the toughest\n"
"TRAINER in the whole HOENN region.\p"
"This town's GYM is led by the TRAINER\n"
"who taught WALLACE.\p"
"But the ELITE FOUR… They're said to be\n"
"even stronger than WALLACE's mentor.\p"
"How strong could they be?$"
msgstr ""
"据说米可利是整个丰缘地区\n"
"最强的训练家。\p"
"这座城市的道馆，\n"
"是由米可利的师父领导的。\p"
"但是四天王……据说\n"
"比米可利的师父还要强。\p"
"他们到底有多强呢？$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:55
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_EveryoneTakenRefuge"
msgid ""
"Everyone in town has taken refuge\n"
"and won't come out of their homes.\p"
"Even I would rather not venture\n"
"outside.$"
msgstr ""
"城里的人都躲了起来，\n"
"不肯从家里出来。\p"
"就连我也不太想\n"
"到外面去。$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:61
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_AlwaysBeFriendsWithPokemon"
msgid ""
"Whenever, wherever, and whatever\n"
"happens, I will always be friends with\l"
"POKéMON.\p"
"Because it's fun to be with POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"无论何时、无论何地、\n"
"无论发生什么事，\l"
"我都会永远和宝可梦做朋友。\p"
"因为和宝可梦在一起很快乐！$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:67
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ArentPokemonOurFriends"
msgid ""
"Aren't POKéMON our friends?\p"
"Why are they going wild this way?$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦不是我们的朋友吗？\p"
"它们为什么会这样发狂呢？$"
